  scope dvd-by-mail-phase

    focus dvd-subscription-model
      kind strategy
      Netflix introduced a subscription model allowing customers to order DVDs online, receive them through mail, keep them as long as they wanted, and return them without late fees.

    reed-hastings chooses dvd-subscription-model
      confidence 0.90 assumed
      note Greater convenience, larger movie catalog, personalized recommendations, monthly subscription pricing.

    observation greater-convenience
      Greater convenience than store visits.

    observation larger-catalog
      Larger movie catalog than physical stores.

    observation personalized-recommendations
      Personalized recommendations.

    observation monthly-subscription
      Monthly subscription pricing.

    supports dvd-subscription-model
