      larger-catalog weight 0.85 assumed
      personalized-recommendations weight 0.85 assumed
      monthly-subscription weight 0.90 assumed

    claim compete-on-experience
      Instead of competing only on price, Netflix competed on customer experience.

    link dvd-subscription-model supports compete-on-experience
      weight 0.90 assumed

  focus streaming-launched-2007
    kind milestone
    In 2007, Netflix launched online streaming.

  observation internet-speeds-improving
    At the time, internet speeds were improving, making online video practical.

  assumption experts-believed-dvds-dominant
    Many experts believed DVDs would remain dominant for years.

  decision netflix-invested-streaming
    Instead of protecting its DVD business, Netflix invested heavily in streaming technology.

  reed-hastings chooses netflix-invested-streaming
    confidence 0.85 estimated
    note This decision fundamentally changed the company.

